# Candidate PNCS Hybrid Memory Grammar v0.3 source.
# Exact commitment occurrence, goal, cue, review condition and evidence travel together.
# Operator names below are requested bindings, not admitted execution authority.
PROGRAM prospective_memory
TASK commitment
INPUT current_state : STATE
INPUT current_context : JSON
INPUT actual_allocation : JSON
INPUT admissible_routes : GRAPH
INPUT cue : BOOLEAN

MEMORY commitment RETAINS STATE RELATION OPERATOR BOUNDARY PERSISTENCE PERSISTENT ACCESS DIRECT LATENT PLASTICITY ADAPTIVE APPEND_ONLY EFFECT CONSTRAINT ROUTING EPISTEMIC HYPOTHESIS
MEMORY commitment_history RETAINS STATE RELATION PATH PERSISTENCE PERSISTENT ACCESS DIRECT PLASTICITY APPEND_ONLY EFFECT CONSTRAINT EPISTEMIC HYPOTHESIS

RECALL commitment_record : JSON FROM commitment MODE DIRECT PROVENANCE RECALLED
COMPUTE verified_allocation : JSON USING verified_allocation_observation INPUT actual_allocation current_context MODE AUTO
REQUIRE verified_source ON compute.verified_allocation
COMPUTE proposal : JSON USING prospective_route_proposal INPUT current_state commitment_record current_context admissible_routes cue MODE AUTO
WHEN cue ENABLE compute.proposal
EVENT allocation_event FROM verified_allocation
TRACE allocation_trace FROM allocation_event INTO commitment_history
LAW commitment_revision FOR commitment USING evidence_bound_commitment_revision
TRACE revision_trace FROM allocation_event INTO commitment LAW commitment_revision
GUIDE compute.proposal USING commitment WHEN cue

RETURN proposal
